      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Soonil\n\nThank you for your patient review. My motivation for modifying this is that we encountered a problem. We saw that the code in the super class was executed in logcat, but EVENT_LOG.logProviderClientRegistered did not see the execution log. Then when onPackageReset, it went to onUnregister and executed EVENT_LOG.logProviderClientUnregistered, which led to the problem we encountered in https://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/issues/369508236.\nBut after seeing your explanation, I understand the principles of your design here, and I think you are right.\n\nThanks a lot\nZhengxiang Sun",
